The source files in this directory are a Swift port of Rick Lupton's
``rmscene`` library (https://github.com/ricklupton/rmscene), which
implements the reMarkable v6 ``.rm`` CRDT codec in Python. A Swift
port is a derivative work under copyright; the original MIT terms
therefore travel with this code.

Both notices below are in effect: the original Python implementation
is Copyright (c) 2023 Rick Lupton, and the Swift port is Copyright
(c) 2026 Madhav Suresh. The license is MIT in both cases.

